  "details": "Camara Freeze Frame would seem like a nice feature to have on the camara because we would be able to make multiple clones of ourselves in a photo or video without need other people to help us.\nThe way it can work is by setting a avatar frozen in place on the camara locally and also having the ability to record animations and play them back afterwards for videos. Being able to stack Other freeze frames would make it possible to have many avatar on the camara at once locally so people are able to make cool photos are videos. And of course being able to delete each freeze frame that is not wanted to make another better one.\nThis will help alot with content creation and help people who are shy to ask others to be in a video/photo a lot.",
